# AIRI-DNA

Digital Provenance Architecture.

## 12 Fingerprint Dimensions

1. Content Hash
2. Structure Hash
3. Semantic Hash
4. Dependency Hash
5. Temporal Hash
6. Provenance Hash
7. Evidence Hash
8. Build Hash
9. Contributor Hash
10. Publication Hash
11. Witness Hash
12. Version Lineage Hash

## Composite

AIRI-DNA = H(D1 || D2 || ... || D12)

## Principles

1. Provenance is not optional
2. Evidence is not assumed
3. History is not mutable
4. Transparency is not absolute
